Changes in version 2026.8.11

- nn_CompositionalAUC_loss(): R/torch port of LibAUC's CompositionalAUCLoss.
  Alternates k cross-entropy batches with k AUC-margin batches. Used together
  with optim_pdsca(PDSCA optimizer for the network weights), and
  make_pdsca_callback.

Changes in version 2025.9.23 (PR#3)

- mlr3_measures$add(...) in register_mlr3().
- change get_nn_ROCAUM_loss fun to torch module class: nn_ROCAUM_loss.

Changes in version 2025.9.8

- batch_sampler_stratified() and batch_sampler_random() adapted from blog.
- measures: MeasureClassifInvAUC, MeasureClassifROCAUM. 
- torch module class generator: get_nn_ROCAUM_loss(env).
